# The build context is the repo root, so this is an allowlist: everything is
# excluded, and the paths the Dockerfile copies are named back in. A directory
# added later stays out until it is named here.
#
# scripts/lib/context.sh reads these paths back to decide what a release
# watches, so this file is load-bearing past the build.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!src
